{"abstract":[{"text":"A query whose filter a system spells as types.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Where"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"F"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"F"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10FilterTermP","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FilterTerm"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A system declares what it reads through the types of its parameters, so it can’t pass a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" value. Instead, it names the filter with filter types, such as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". A system that counts the entities with a position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that aren’t frozen declares a parameter of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Query<Position>.Where<Without<Frozen>>"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and iterates it like the query it holds:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct ThawedCount: Resource { var value = 0 }","","@System","struct CountThawedPositions {","    func run(_ positions: Query<Position>.Where<Without<Frozen>>, count: ResourceWriter<ThawedCount>) {","        count.value.value = 0","        for _ in positions {","            count.value.value += 1","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(ThawedCount())","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0))","world.spawn(Position(x: 1, y: 1), Frozen())","","Schedule { CountThawedPositions() }.run(on: &world)","print(world.resources[ThawedCount.self].value)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Listing several filter types passes the entities that pass all of them. Each filter type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stands for a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Where"},{"type":"text","text":" type’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where\/filter","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" combines them:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let filter = Query<Health>.Where<Changed<Health>, Without<Frozen>>.filter","print(filter == QueryFilter.changed(Health.self).without(Frozen.self))","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of filter types to pass the entities that pass at least one of them."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/query\/where"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/ST"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV5WhereV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Where","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"each T","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"QueryTerm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Query.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Query.swift#L349"},"title":"Query.Where","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Where"}],"extendedModule":"WorldModule","roleHeading":"Structure"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where\/first","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where\/query"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where\/makeIterator()"]},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModu